# Android / Gradle build output — regenerable, never committed.
#
# Added during the 2026-08-07 git-hygiene pass: `git add android` would
# otherwise stage ~142 MB across 4,297 files, dominated by NDK build output
# under mk-native/.cxx/ (four libfreetyped.a at ~4–5.5 MB each, four
# liblcms2.a at ~1.7–2.3 MB each) and Gradle's own caches. The root
# .gitignore's `build/` rule catches Gradle module output but NOT `.cxx/`
# (externalNativeBuild's own tree) or `.gradle/`, which is why this file
# exists rather than a couple of extra root-level lines.

# Gradle
.gradle/
local.properties
gradle-app.setting
.gradletasknamecache

# NDK / externalNativeBuild — mk-native's C/C++ artifacts (D-304 vendors
# HarfBuzz, FreeType and lcms2 as source; their compiled .a files are not
# source and rebuild from it).
.cxx/
obj/

# Build output (belt-and-suspenders — root .gitignore already has `build/`,
# repeated here so this file is self-contained if the module ever moves).
build/
captures/

# Signing material — must never enter the repo. D-322 uses Play App Signing;
# the upload keystore is a local secret.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
